    "updated_at": "2015-08-29T00:21:22Z",
    "body": "CreateDataProperty() should, ostensibly, never throw here. Given that the properties are only being set on a newly minted Object there shouldn't be a custom [[DefineOwnProperty]] in place, and modifications to the ambient %ObjectPrototype% would not affect that operation. But I defer to @domenic and true ES experts here.\n",
